# Component-centric folders

Prefer colocation: put a component with its tests, hooks, types, and small helpers in one folder. Route files stay thin.

## Layout

```text
src/
  app/                         # Next.js routes only (page, layout, loading)
  components/
    home/                      # feature/domain folder
      HomeHeroSection.tsx      # public component (matches filename)
      HomeHeroSection.test.tsx
      CompactGuestSelect.tsx
      CompactGuestSelect.test.tsx
      useHeroSearch.ts         # local hook (home-only)
      useBookingModal.ts       # local hook (home-only)
      homeCars.ts              # local helpers
      types.ts                 # local types
    SiteHeader.tsx             # shared, used in 2+ features → keep flat or shared/
  hooks/                       # shared hooks only (2+ features)
  lib/                         # shared pure utilities
  types/                       # shared domain types
```

## Rules

- **One main component per file**; filename = export name (`HomeFaqSection.tsx` → `HomeFaqSection`).
- **Feature folder** when a UI area has 2+ related files (`components/home/`, `components/booking/`).
- **Colocate tests** next to the unit: `Foo.tsx` + `Foo.test.tsx`.
- **Local first:** hook/helper used by one feature stays in that folder. Move to `src/hooks/` or `src/lib/` only when reused by 2+ features.
- **No deep barrels** (`index.ts` re-exporting everything) unless the folder is a stable public API.
- **App Router:** `src/app/**/page.tsx` composes feature components; avoid large client logic in route files.
- **`"use client"`** only on components that need browser APIs, state, or events — keep leaves client, parents server when possible.
- **Do not** create `components/common/`, `components/ui/` dumps for feature-specific widgets. Shared primitives only when truly generic.

## Examples

```text
✅ components/home/HomeCarsSection.tsx
✅ components/home/homeCars.ts
✅ components/home/useHeroSearch.ts

❌ components/HomeCarsSection.tsx + hooks/useHomeCarsOnly.ts scattered
❌ app/LocalePageClient.tsx with 1000+ lines of section JSX
```
